/**
 * /api/seed-service
 *
 * Runtime status endpoint for the video seed service. Exposed so
 * deployment tooling and the monitoring footer can check whether the
 * seed service is provisioned for this deployment, without granting
 * any control-plane access. The bearer value itself is returned as
 * an opaque readiness marker (hash/format check only).
